WEBVTT

00:13:58.058 --> 00:14:00.824
linaitwa Vitoaji vya Maji Salama.

00:14:00.864 --> 00:14:02.450
Na nikajihusisha.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.046
Na sitarajii kamati
ya Nobel Prize

00:14:05.098 --> 00:14:06.514
kunigongea mlangoni,

00:14:06.554 --> 00:14:10.410
lakini ni hatua ndogo,
ni kitu kidogo.

00:14:10.448 --> 00:14:12.944
Na yote ni kwa sababu ya shukrani.

00:14:12.984 --> 00:14:16.910
Na ndio maana natia moyo
watu, marafiki, familia,

00:14:17.008 --> 00:14:19.944
kufuata njia zao za shukrani.

00:14:20.008 --> 00:14:22.684
Kwa sababu ni jambo
la kubadilisha maisha.

00:14:22.792 --> 00:14:24.388
Na sio lazima iwe kahawa.

00:14:24.432 --> 00:14:25.718
Inaweza kua chochote.

00:14:25.718 --> 00:14:27.968
Inaweza kua soksi, inaweza kua
taa ya mwanga.

00:14:28.028 --> 00:14:31.514
Na sio lazima uzunguke duniani
unaweza kufanya tu ishara ndogo,